    "Σ(CL × VCC² × fo)": "the output term added up over every output"
   },
   "note": "",
   "page": 9
  }
 ],
 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Clocking",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Each of the two flip-flops has its own clock nCP and data input nD. On a LOW-to-HIGH nCP edge, nQ takes the level that nD held steady for tsu before the edge and th after it, and nQ̅ takes the opposite level."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Clock input",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The clock input has Schmitt-trigger action, so the clock may have slow edges."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Asynchronous set and reset",
   "page": 4,
   "text": "nS̅D̅ LOW forces nQ HIGH and nQ̅ LOW; nR̅D̅ LOW forces nQ LOW and nQ̅ HIGH; both act regardless of nCP and nD. With both LOW, nQ and nQ̅ are both HIGH. After set or reset returns HIGH, the recovery time trec must pass before a clock edge is taken."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Input clamp diodes",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Every input has clamp diodes, so an input can be driven from a voltage above VCC through a series resistor that limits the clamp current."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Input levels",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "74HC74 inputs switch at CMOS levels and run from 2.0 V to 6.0 V. 74HCT74 inputs switch at TTL levels and run from 4.5 V to 5.5 V. Outputs have symmetrical impedance and balanced propagation delays. The parts meet JESD7A (2.0 V to 6.0 V) and JESD8C (2.7 V to 3.6 V), and are specified over -40 °C to +85 °C and -40 °C to +125 °C."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Timing reference levels",
   "page": 11,
   "text": "Timing is measured between input and output crossings of VM: 0.5VCC for the 74HC74, 1.3 V for the 74HCT74, with input pulses of VCC or 3 V and 6 ns edges. Output transition time runs between 10 % and 90 % of the swing."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Exposed pad",
   "page": 3,
   "text": "On the DHVQFN14 and DHXQFN14 packages the centre pad carries no ground connection and needs no solder for electrical or mechanical reasons; if soldered, its land is left floating or tied to GND."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Qualification",
   "page": 18,
   "text": "The part is not qualified or tested for automotive use."
  }
 ],
